Z||000013||mwbackus||08-29-99||02:08 AM||||Just wanted to point something out for clarity.  In my discussions with IRM about the various air dams they offer, I found out that the one pictured is part of the $3500 kit designed for pre-87 coupes, and they no longer have these in stock.  The $140 air dam is different, will fit any standard (ie..coupe, formula) style body, but is ONLY available with driving/fog light cutouts.  The picture of it in the IRM catalog is not of good quality, but they are obviously not the same design.<p>Mike
Z||000014||lowCG||08-31-99||07:55 PM||||That spring part # should read 355.1005,not 355.1001,for anyone who cares.
